{"text":"正始五年八月十五日，比丘惠合爲清信女□法景造釋迦佛并菩薩二區。願七世父母、所生父母、因緣眷屬、一切衆生，一時成佛。","tags":[{"name":"PersonName","term":"惠合","refId":null,"text":"惠合","start":12,"end":14},{"name":"Udef_Buddhist_Term","term":"釋迦","refId":null,"text":"釋迦","start":22,"end":24},{"name":"Udef_Buddhist_Term","term":"菩薩","refId":null,"text":"菩薩","start":26,"end":28},{"name":"Udef_Buddhist_Term","term":"因緣","refId":null,"text":"因緣","start":42,"end":44},{"name":"Udef_Buddhist_Term","term":"眾生","refId":null,"text":"衆生","start":49,"end":51}]}